WEBVTT

00:20:29.365 --> 00:20:32.991
feel intensely the kinds
of feelings that introverts feel?

00:20:33.015 --> 00:20:35.443
Even someone who shades extrovert overall

00:20:35.467 --> 00:20:38.962
can actually, perhaps,
learn from some of this?

00:20:38.986 --> 00:20:41.037
SC: Yeah. I think that's right.

00:20:41.061 --> 00:20:44.254
I think there are some people for whom
the introvert label is like,

00:20:44.278 --> 00:20:46.236
"OK, that really is me."

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:49.729
And then there's other people where,
yeah, they just have that experience

00:20:49.753 --> 00:20:50.918
from time to time.

00:20:50.942 --> 00:20:52.867
Maybe they have it in a back-to-back day

00:20:52.891 --> 00:20:54.979
of company meetings
or something like that.

00:20:55.003 --> 00:20:57.557
And I think what's really happening is,

00:20:57.581 --> 00:21:00.855
for all the talk about
how we're all disappearing